{
  "info": {
    "name": "tuLlave Recargas API",
    "description": "Colección de la API de recargas digitales tuLlave.\n\nIncluye casos exitosos y de error para cada endpoint. Cada request trae pruebas automáticas (pestaña *Tests*), así que la colección completa puede ejecutarse con el Collection Runner o con Newman:\n\n`newman run postman/tuLlave-Recargas-API.postman_collection.json -e postman/tuLlave-Local.postman_environment.json`\n\nLas carpetas están pensadas para ejecutarse en orden: el POST exitoso guarda el id creado en la variable `rechargeId`, que luego usan GET por id y DELETE.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "cardNumber", "value": "1010000012345678" },
    { "key": "rechargeId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Pruebas comunes a toda la colección",
          "pm.test('Responde en menos de 2 s', () => pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(2000));",
          "if (pm.response.code >= 400) {",
          "    pm.test('Error con formato estándar', () => {",
          "        const body = pm.response.json();",
          "        pm.expect(body).to.include.all.keys('timestamp', 'status', 'error', 'message', 'path');",
          "        pm.expect(body.status).to.eql(pm.response.code);",
          "    });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Crear recarga",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST recarga válida (201)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Header Location apunta al recurso creado', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location')).to.include('/api/v1/recharges/');",
                  "});",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Cuerpo con id, reference y createdAt autogenerados', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.id).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.reference).to.match(/^[0-9a-f-]{36}$/);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.createdAt).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve los datos enviados', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.cardNumber).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('cardNumber'));",
                  "    pm.expect(body.amount).to.eql(50000);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.paymentMethod).to.eql('NEQUI');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('rechargeId', body.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cardNumber\": \"{{cardNumber}}\",\n  \"amount\": 50000,\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"NEQUI\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recharges", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "recharges"] }
          }
        },
